@@ -99,5 +99,7 @@ GHOST_TSuccess GHOST_ContextWGPU::initializeDrawingContext()
    *   - Float32Filterable: enables linear filtering for R/RG/RGBA 32-bit float
    *     textures, matching the backend's format-capability gate.
+   *   - TextureComponentSwizzle: applies Blender's sampled-texture channel masks
